          >
            <div class="theme-padding-xs section-xs">
              <h3 class="mb-5 fw-500 line-reveal">Project Overview</h3>

              <p>
                As the world is moving towards digitalization at the fastest
                pace ever possible, Bhavnagar’s best dental care hospital “City
                Dental Care” wanted to join the race too with the aim to make
                more smiles brighter, by making an online platform from where
                all the patients looking for dental treatments could reach-out
                to them..
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="is-relative">
              <div class="theme-h-line"></div>
